        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "0b948158-b8a9-50d2-bfb7-434556da636f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ross Case; Slobodan Živojinović\n- Events: 1974 Pacific Coast Open; 1988 Swan Premium Open; 1985 Australian Open; 1986 Wimbledon Championships\n- Roles: tennis players\n- Concepts: singles title; world ranking\n\nFacts:\n- Ross Case was born on 1 November 1951 and is an Australian former tennis player.\n- In 1974, unseeded Ross Case won the singles title at the 1974 Pacific Coast Open, along with $16,000 in first-prize money and 80 Grand Prix points.\n- In 1985, Slobodan Živojinović reached the semi-finals of the Australian Open singles event.\n- In 1986, Slobodan Živojinović reached the semi-finals of the Wimbledon Championships singles event and achieved a career-high ranking of World No. 19.\n- In 1988, fifth-seeded Slobodan Živojinović won the singles title at the 1988 Swan Premium Open.",
